# burn the budget that refreshes soonest first, keep freshly refreshed
# balances intact. Percentage floors relative to the key's OWN capacity
# (QUOTA_FLOOR_5H_PCT=0.10, QUOTA_FLOOR_WEEKLY_PCT=0.02) demote keys that
# are functionally exhausted for their tier to a severity- then refill-
# ordered tail; ranking stays absolute (rate, usable) so mixed plan tiers
# stay comparable (a cheap key's 200 tokens never outrank 280). Lead tier
# = keys whose min(R5, RW) covers the derived reserve 0.75 x max(cap5)
# across the queue (no env knob — scales itself down for cheap-only pools);
# above-floor keys that cannot cover a leg fill after the leader by usable
# desc; with no leg-fit key the gates stay transparent (most usable
