# order); every other probe failure (non-200, timeout, unparseable/changed
# shape, missing curl/node) keeps the static position and NEVER fails the
# leg — the endpoint is undocumented, its shape can change without notice.
# A missing weekly row degrades to 5h-only scoring (non-fatal).
# Key topology note: entries are keyed by the KEY VALUE, so same-account
# key sets collapse to one probe and full-equal scores keep the static
# order (no churn). Kill switch: FA_QUOTA_PROBE=off (or 0/false, any case)
# skips probing entirely; default ON, zai entries only — other providers
